msgid "The commands"
msgstr "命令"

msgid "``RS2``,\\ *options*"
msgstr "``RS2``,\\ *选项*"

msgid "``RS2C``,\\ *options*"
msgstr "``RS2C``,\\ *选项*"

msgid "``RS3``,\\ *options*"
msgstr "``RS3``,\\ *选项*"

msgid ""
"are used to perform second or third-order perturbation calculations. ``RS3``"
" always includes ``RS2`` as a first step. For closed-shell single-reference "
"cases, this is equivalent to ``MP2`` or ``MP3`` (but a different program is "
"used). ``RS2C`` calls a new more efficient second-order program (see below),"
" which should normally be used if third-order is not required (note that "
"``RS3C`` is not available). Analytic gradients are only available for the "
"``RS2`` program."
msgstr ""
"用于执行二阶或三阶微扰计算。\\ ``RS3`` 总是包含 ``RS2`` 作为第一步。对于闭壳层单参考情况，这等价于 ``MP2`` 或 "
"``MP3``\\ （但使用了不同的程序）。\\ ``RS2C`` 调用一个新的、更高效的二阶程序（见下文），如果不需要三阶计算，通常应使用此程序（注意"
" ``RS3C`` 不可用）。解析梯度仅适用于 ``RS2`` 程序。"

msgid ""
"for ``RS2`` an explicitly correlated version as described in T. Shiozaki and"
" H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3489000>`__ "
"**133**, 141103 (2010) is available. This is called using the command"
msgstr ""
"对于 ``RS2``\\ ，存在一个如 T. Shiozaki 和 H.-J. Werner 在 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3489000>`__ **133**, 141103 (2010) "
"中描述的显式相关版本。这通过命令调用"

msgid "``RS2-F12``, *options*"
msgstr "``RS2-F12``, *选项*"

msgid "*Options* can be the following:"
msgstr "*选项* 可以是以下内容："

msgid ""
"``Gn`` Use modified zeroth order Hamiltonian, see section `modified Fock-"
"operators in the zeroth-order Hamiltonian. "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#modified-"
"fock-operators-in-the-zeroth-order-hamiltonian>`__"
msgstr ""
"``Gn`` 使用修改的零阶哈密顿量，参见章节 `零阶哈密顿量中的修改福克算符。 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#modified-"
"fock-operators-in-the-zeroth-order-hamiltonian>`__"

msgid ""
"``INIT`` (logical) Initializes a MS-CASPT2 with single state reference "
"functions, see section `Multi-State CASPT2 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#multi-state-"
"caspt2>`__"
msgstr ""
"``INIT`` （逻辑值）使用单态参考函数初始化 MS-CASPT2，参见 `Multi-State CASPT2 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#multi-state-"
"caspt2>`__ 一节"

msgid ""
"``IGNORE`` (logical) Flags an approximate gradient calculation without CP-"
"CASPT2; see section `CASPT2 gradients "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#caspt2-gradients>`__"
" for details."
msgstr ""
"``IGNORE`` (逻辑值) 标记一个不使用 CP-CASPT2 的近似梯度计算；详见章节 `CASPT2 梯度 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#caspt2-gradients>`__\\"
" 。"

msgid ""
"``PROPERTIES`` or ``PROP`` (logical, default true, ``RS2C`` only) Flag on "
"whether the expectation values of properties are computed. By default dipole"
" moments are always computed but this may be expensive in multi-state "
"calculations. Pass ``NOPROP`` to skip the property calculation."
msgstr ""
"``PROPERTIES`` 或 ``PROP`` (逻辑值，默认为 true，仅限 ``RS2C``) "
"标记是否计算性质的期望值。默认情况下总是计算偶极矩，但在多态计算中这可能很耗时。传递 ``NOPROP`` 以跳过性质计算。"

msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

msgid ""
"Multireference perturbation calculations are performed by the MRCI program "
"as a special case. For RS2 (CASPT2,RASPT2) only matrix elements over a one-"
"electron operator need to be computed, and therefore the computational "
"effort is much smaller than for a corresponding MRCI. For RS3 (CASPT3) the "
"energy expectation value for the first-order wavefunction must be computed "
"and the computational effort is about the same as for one MRCI iteration. "
"The RS2 and RS3 programs use the same configuration spaces as the MRCI, "
"i.e., only the doubly external configurations are internally contracted."
msgstr ""
"多参考微扰计算由 MRCI 程序作为特例执行。对于 RS2 (CASPT2, RASPT2)，只需计算单电子算符上的矩阵元，因此计算量远小于相应的 "
"MRCI。对于 RS3 (CASPT3)，必须计算一阶波函数的能量期望值，计算量大约相当于一次 MRCI 迭代。RS2 和 RS3 程序使用与 MRCI"
" 相同的组态空间，即只有双外部组态是内收缩的。"

msgid ""
"A new version of the program has been implemented in which also subspaces of"
" the singly external and internal configuration spaces are internally "
"contracted (see reference given above). This program, which is called using "
"the keyword ``RS2C``, is more efficient than ``RS2``, in particular for "
"large molecules with many closed-shell (inactive) orbitals. It is "
"recommended to use this program for normal applications of second-order "
"multireference perturbation theory (CASPT2, RASPT2). Note that it gives "
"slightly different results than ``RS2`` due to the different contraction "
"scheme. It should also be noted that neither ``RS2`` or ``RS2C`` are "
"identical with the CASPT2 of Roos et al. `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.462209>`__ **96**, 1218 (1992), since certain "
"configuration subspaces are left uncontracted. However, the differences are "
"normally very small. The last point that should be mentioned is that the "
"calculation of CASPT2/RASPT2 density matrices (and therefore molecular "
"properties) is presently possible only with the RS2 command and *not* with "
"RS2C."
msgstr ""
"已实现程序的新版本，其中单外部和内部组态空间的子空间也是内收缩的（参见上文给出的参考文献）。该程序使用关键字 ``RS2C`` 调用，比 ``RS2``"
" 更高效，特别是对于具有许多闭壳层（非活性）轨道的大分子。建议在二阶多参考微扰理论 (CASPT2, RASPT2) "
"的正常应用中使用此程序。请注意，由于收缩方案不同，它给出的结果与 ``RS2`` 略有不同。还应注意，\\ ``RS2`` 或 ``RS2C`` 都与 "
"Roos 等人的 CASPT2 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.462209>`__ "
"**96**, 1218 (1992) 不完全相同，因为某些组态子空间未收缩。然而，差异通常非常小。最后需要指出的是，CASPT2/RASPT2 "
"密度矩阵（以及因此分子性质）的计算目前仅能通过 RS2 命令实现，\\ *不能*\\ 通过 RS2C。"

msgid ""
"With no further input cards, the wavefunction definition (core, closed, and "
"active orbital spaces, symmetry) corresponds to the one used in the most "
"recently done SCF or MCSCF calculation. By default, a CASSCF reference space"
" is generated. Other choices can be made using the ``OCC``, ``CORE``, "
"``CLOSED``, ``WF``, ``SELECT``, ``CON``, and ``RESTRICT`` cards, as "
"described for the ``CI`` program. The orbitals are taken from the "
"corresponding SCF or MCSCF calculation unless an ``ORBITAL`` directive is "
"given."
msgstr ""
"若无进一步的输入卡片，波函数定义（芯层、闭壳层和活性轨道空间，对称性）对应于最近一次 SCF 或 MCSCF 计算所使用的定义。默认情况下，会生成一个 "
"CASSCF 参考空间。可以使用 ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``CORE``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED``\\ 、\\ ``WF``\\ 、\\ "
"``SELECT``\\ 、\\ ``CON`` 和 ``RESTRICT`` 卡片进行其他选择，如 ``CI`` 程序所述。除非给出 "
"``ORBITAL`` 指令，否则轨道取自相应的 SCF 或 MCSCF 计算。"

msgid ""
"For a CASPT2 calculation, the zeroth-order Hamiltonian can be brought to a "
"block-diagonal form when (pseudo)canonical orbitals are used. This leads to "
"fastest convergence. It is therefore recommended that in the preceding "
"``MULTI`` calculation the orbitals are saved using the ``CANONICAL`` "
"directive (note that the default is ``NATORB``)."
msgstr ""
"对于 CASPT2 计算，当使用（伪）正则轨道时，零阶哈密顿量可以化为块对角形式。这能实现最快的收敛。因此建议在之前的 ``MULTI`` 计算中使用 "
"``CANONICAL`` 指令保存轨道（注意默认是 ``NATORB``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"Most options for MRCI calculations (like ``STATE``, ``REFSTATE`` etc.) apply"
" also for RS2(C) and RS3 and are not described here again. Some additional "
"options which specific for CASPT2/3 and are described below."
msgstr ""
"大多数 MRCI 计算的选项（如 ``STATE``\\ 、\\ ``REFSTATE`` 等）同样适用于 RS2(C) 和 "
"RS3，此处不再赘述。一些专用于 CASPT2/3 的附加选项将在下面描述。"

msgid "Excited state calculations"
msgstr "激发态计算"

msgid "There are two possibilities to perform excited state calculations:"
msgstr "有两种执行激发态计算的可能性："

msgid "One can calculate each state separately. This is done using the card"
msgstr "可以分别计算每个态。这通过使用卡片"

msgid ""
"where *n* is the number of states to be computed. The default is to compute "
"the lowest *n* roots. Optionally, this default can be modified by specifying"
" the desired roots *rooti* as shown. One should note that this *does not* "
"correspond to the multi-state CASPT2 as described in section `Multi-State "
"CASPT2 <multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#multi-"
"state-caspt2>`__."
msgstr ""
"其中 *n* 是要计算的态的数量。默认是计算最低的 *n* 个根。可选地，可以通过指定所需的根 *rooti* "
"来修改此默认设置，如上所示。需要注意的是，这\\ *并不*\\ 对应于 `Multi-State CASPT2 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#multi-state-"
"caspt2>`__ 章节中描述的多态 CASPT2。"

msgid ""
"In the case that several states are computed simultaneously, the fock "
"operator employed in the zeroth-order Hamiltonian is computed from a state-"
"averaged density matrix, and the zeroth-order Hamiltonians for all states "
"are constructed from the same fock operator. By default, equal weights for "
"all states are used. This default can be modified using the ``WEIGHT`` "
"directive"
msgstr ""
"在同时计算多个态的情况下，用于零阶哈密顿量的 Fock 算符是从态平均密度矩阵计算得到的，并且所有态的零阶哈密顿量都由同一个 Fock "
"算符构建。默认情况下，所有态使用相等的权重。可以使用 ``WEIGHT`` 指令修改此默认设置"

msgid ""
"If a ``REFSTATE`` card is given (see section `defining reference state "
"numbers <the_mrci_program.html#defining-reference-state-numbers>`__), the "
"state-averaged fock operator is made for all reference states, and the "
"``WEIGHT`` card refers to the corresponding states."
msgstr ""
"如果给出了 ``REFSTATE`` 卡片（参见 `defining reference state numbers "
"<the_mrci_program.html#defining-reference-state-numbers>`__ 章节），则态平均 Fock "
"算符是针对所有参考态构建的，并且 ``WEIGHT`` 卡片指的是相应的态。"

msgid ""
"In the case of RS3 the Hamiltonian is diagonalized at the end of "
"calculations using first-order wavefunctions, and the diagonal and "
"transition properties are transformed accordingly. The untransformed "
"properties, if required, can be retrieved from the output."
msgstr ""
"对于 RS3 的情况，哈密顿量在计算结束时使用一阶波函数进行对角化，对角性质和跃迁性质也相应地进行变换。如果需要，未变换的性质可以从输出中获取。"

msgid "Multi-State CASPT2"
msgstr "多态 CASPT2"

msgid ""
"Multi-state CASPT2 is implemented as described by Finley et al. CPL **288**,"
" 299 (1998). This can be done with ``RS2`` or ``RS2C`` (since Molpro 2021). "
"In both cases there are two different modes in which MS-CASPT2 calculations "
"can be performed:"
msgstr ""
"多态 CASPT2 的实现如 Finley 等人所述 [CPL **288**, 299 (1998)]。这可以通过 ``RS2`` 或 "
"``RS2C``\\ （自 Molpro 2021 起）完成。在这两种情况下，执行 MS-CASPT2 计算有两种不同的模式："

msgid ""
"With the ``RS2C`` program the two modes can be mixed, e.g., in a 3-state "
"calculation using the SS-SR-CASPT2 for one state and the MS-MR-CASPT2 for "
"the other two states."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``RS2C`` 程序，这两种模式可以混合，例如，在一个 3 态计算中，对一个态使用 SS-SR-CASPT2，对另外两个态使用 MS-MR-"
"CASPT2。"

msgid "Performing SS-SR-CASPT2 calculations"
msgstr "执行 SS-SR-CASPT2 计算"

msgid ""
"If one wants to mix together *nstates* CASPT2 wavefunctions, a *nstates* "
"single-state, single-reference CASPT2 calculations must be run."
msgstr "如果想要混合 *nstates* 个 CASPT2 波函数，必须运行 *nstates* 个单态、单参考 CASPT2 计算。"

msgid "The first calculation must use"
msgstr "第一个计算必须使用"

msgid "and the subsequent ones"
msgstr "以及后续的"

msgid ""
"for :math:`istate=2,\\ldots,nstates`. Further *options* can be given, for "
"instance a level shift."
msgstr "对于 :math:`istate=2,\\ldots,nstates`\\ 。可以指定进一步的 *options*\\ ，例如能级位移。"

msgid ""
"At the end of each calculation, the CASPT2 wavefunction is stored, and at "
"the end of the last CASPT2 calculation the Bloch Hamiltonian and the "
"corresponding overlap matrix are automatically assembled and printed. The "
"Hamiltonian is diagonalized after symmetrization following Brandow IJQC 15, "
"207 (1979), as well as with simple half-sum (averaging). The MS-CASPT2 "
"energy and mixing coefficients printed in each case."
msgstr ""
"在每次计算结束时，CASPT2 波函数会被存储，并且在最后一次 CASPT2 计算结束时，Bloch "
"哈密顿量和相应的重叠矩阵会自动组装并打印。哈密顿量会按照 Brandow IJQC 15, 207 (1979) "
"的方法进行对称化后对角化，同时也会进行简单的半和（平均）对角化。每种情况下都会打印 MS-CASPT2 能量和混合系数。"

msgid ""
"The variable MSENERGY(i) (with i=1,...nstates) is set to the multi-state "
"energies obtained with half-sum diagonalization. If a Level Shift is "
"present, MSENERGY(i) contains the multi-state energies obtained with half-"
"sum diagonalization of the Bloch Hamiltonian whose diagonal elements (CASPT2"
" energies) have been corrected with the level shift."
msgstr ""
"变量 MSENERGY(i)（其中 i=1,…nstates）被设置为通过半和对角化获得的多态能量。如果存在能级位移，MSENERGY(i) 包含的是对"
" Bloch 哈密顿量进行半和对角化获得的多态能量，该 Bloch 哈密顿量的对角元（CASPT2 能量）已用能级位移进行了修正。"

msgid "Example: SS-SR-CASPT2 calculation for LiF"
msgstr "示例：LiF 的 SS-SR-CASPT2 计算"

msgid "This produces the plot"
msgstr "这将生成图表"

msgid "lif_sr_mscaspt2.svg"
msgstr "lif_sr_mscaspt2.svg"

msgid "Performing MS-MR-CASPT2 calculations"
msgstr "执行MS-MR-CASPT2计算"

msgid ""
"In the case of multi-state multi-reference CASPT2 calculations, only a "
"single run is needed:"
msgstr "对于多态多参考CASPT2计算，仅需单次运行："

msgid ""
"For using the XMS-CASPT2 method option ``XMS=1`` or ``XMS=2`` has to be set."
" The two variants differ in the treatment of level shifts. ``XMS=1`` is a "
"fully invariant treatment (recommended), while with ``XMS=2`` the level "
"shift is only applied to the diagonal of H0."
msgstr ""
"使用XMS-CASPT2方法时需设置选项\\ ``XMS=1``\\ 或\\ ``XMS=2``\\ 。两种变体在处理能级位移时有所不同。\\ "
"``XMS=1``\\ 是完全不变的处理方式（推荐），而\\ ``XMS=2``\\ 仅将能级位移应用于H0的对角线。"

msgid ""
"At the end of calculations, the reference states and diagonal and transition"
" properties are transformed according of the transformation of mixed CASPT2 "
"states. Corresponding transformed energies and properties can be obtained "
"from MS-prefixed variables, for example MSENERGR(i) or MSTRDMZ etc."
msgstr ""
"计算结束时，参考态以及对角和跃迁性质会根据混合CASPT2态的变换进行转换。相应的转换后能量和性质可从MS前缀的变量获取，例如MSENERGR(i)或MSTRDMZ等。"

msgid "Example: MS-MR-CASPT2 calculation for LiF"
msgstr "示例：LiF 的 MS-MR-CASPT2 计算"

msgid "lif_mr_mscaspt2.svg"
msgstr "lif_mr_mscaspt2.svg"

msgid ""
"One can clearly see that this gives smoother potentials than the SS-SR-"
"CASPT2 calculation in the previous section. Also, the avoided crossing is "
"shifted to longer distances, which is due to the improvement of the electron"
" affinity of F."
msgstr ""
"可以清楚地看到，这比上一节中的 SS-SR-CASPT2 计算给出了更平滑的势能曲线。此外，避免交叉被移至更长的距离，这是由于 F "
"的电子亲和能得到了改善。"

msgid ""
"Example for XMS-CASPT2 for pyrrole :math:`B_1` states, using ``RS2C`` and "
"density fitting"
msgstr "使用 ``RS2C`` 和密度拟合对吡咯 :math:`B_1` 态进行 XMS-CASPT2 的示例"

msgid "This produces:"
msgstr "这将产生："

msgid "Modified Fock-operators in the zeroth-order Hamiltonian"
msgstr "零阶哈密顿量中的修正 Fock 算符"

msgid ""
"The :math:`g_1`, :math:`g_2`, and :math:`g_3` operators proposed by "
"Andersson [Theor. Chim. Acta **91**, 31 (1995)] as well as a further "
":math:`g_4` operator may be used. :math:`g_4` makes CASPT2 calculations size"
" extensive for cases in which a molecule dissociates to high-spin open-shell"
" (RHF) atoms."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 Andersson [Theor. Chim. Acta **91**, 31 (1995)] 提出的 :math:`g_1`\\ 、\\ "
":math:`g_2` 和 :math:`g_3` 算符以及进一步的 :math:`g_4` 算符。\\ :math:`g_4` 使得 CASPT2 "
"计算在分子解离为高自旋开壳层 (RHF) 原子的情况下具有尺寸广延性。"

msgid ""
"The index *n* of the operator to be used is specified on the ``RS2``, "
"``RS2C``, or ``RS3`` card:"
msgstr "要使用的算符索引 *n* 在 ``RS2``\\ 、\\ ``RS2C`` 或 ``RS3`` 卡片上指定："

msgid ""
"where *option* can be ``G1``, ``G2``, ``G3``, or ``G4``. This option can be "
"followed or preceded by other valid options."
msgstr "其中 *选项* 可以是 ``G1``\\ 、\\ ``G2``\\ 、\\ ``G3`` 或 ``G4``\\ 。此选项前后可以跟随其他有效选项。"

msgid "Level shifts"
msgstr "能级位移"

msgid ""
"Level shifts are often useful to avoid intruder state problems in excited "
"state calculations. ``MOLPRO`` allows the use of shifts as described by Roos"
" and Andersson, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(95)01010-7>`__ **245**, 215 (1995). "
"The shift can be specified on the ``RS2`` or ``RS2C`` card"
msgstr ""
"能级位移通常有助于避免激发态计算中的入侵态问题。\\ ``MOLPRO`` 允许使用 Roos 和 Andersson 描述的位移，\\ `Chem. "
"Phys. Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(95)01010-7>`__ **245**, "
"215 (1995)。位移可以在 ``RS2`` 或 ``RS2C`` 卡片上指定"

msgid ""
"Typical choices for the shift is are :math:`0.1 - 0.3`. Only two figures "
"after the decimal point are considered. The shift affects the results, the "
"printed energies as well as the ``ENERGY`` variable include the energy "
"correction for the shift as proposed by Roos and Andersson. At convergence, "
"also the uncorrected energies are printed for comparison."
msgstr ""
"位移的典型选择是 :math:`0.1 - 0.3`\\ 。仅考虑小数点后两位数字。该位移会影响结果，打印的能量以及 ``ENERGY`` 变量都包含了"
" Roos 和 Andersson 提出的位移能量校正。收敛时，也会打印未校正的能量以供比较。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively (or in addition), the IPEA shift of G. Ghigo, B. O. Roos, and "
"P.A. Malmqvist, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2004.08.032>`__ **396**, 142 (2004) can"
" be used. The implementation is not exactly identical to the one in MOLCAS, "
"since in our program the singly external configurations are not (RS2) or "
"only partially (RS2C) contracted. In Molpro, the shift is implemented as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"或者（或同时），可以使用 G. Ghigo、B. O. Roos 和 P.A. Malmqvist 提出的 IPEA 位移，见 `Chem. Phys."
" Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2004.08.032>`__ **396**, 142 "
"(2004)。其实现与 MOLCAS 中的不完全相同，因为在我们程序中，单外部组态未被收缩（RS2）或仅部分收缩（RS2C）。在 Molpro "
"中，该位移的实现如下："

msgid ""
":math:`\\frac{1}{2} D_{pp} \\epsilon` is added to the occupied part of the "
"Fock matrix; in addition, :math:`2 \\epsilon` is added as a general shift "
"(not corrected). :math:`\\epsilon` is the value specified with the ``IPEA`` "
"option (default 0). A value of 0.20-0.25 is recommended. This removes "
"intruder state problems to a large extent and usually improves the results. "
"Note that the method is not exactly orbital invariant, and pseudo-canonical "
"orbitals should be used (see ``CANONICAL`` option in MULTI)."
msgstr ""
":math:`\\frac{1}{2} D_{pp} \\epsilon` 被添加到 Fock 矩阵的占据部分；此外，\\ :math:`2 "
"\\epsilon` 被添加为一个通用位移（未校正）。\\ :math:`\\epsilon` 是由 ``IPEA`` 选项指定的值（默认为 "
"0）。推荐值为 0.20-0.25。这能在很大程度上消除入侵态问题，并且通常会改善结果。请注意，该方法并非完全轨道不变，应使用准正则轨道（参见 "
"MULTI 中的 ``CANONICAL`` 选项）。"

msgid ""
"It is possible to use ``SHIFT`` and ``IPEA`` simultaneously, but it does not"
" make sense to use one of the ``G``-options together with ``IPEA``."
msgstr "可以同时使用 ``SHIFT`` 和 ``IPEA``\\ ，但将 ``G`` 选项之一与 ``IPEA`` 一起使用没有意义。"

msgid "Integral direct calculations"
msgstr "直接积分计算"

msgid ""
"``RS2``, ``RS2C``, and ``RS3`` calculations with very large basis sets can "
"be performed in integral-direct mode. The calculation will be direct if a "
"global ``DIRECT`` or ``GDIRECT`` card appears earlier in the input. "
"Alternatively, (mainly for testing) ``DIRECT`` can be specified as an option"
" on the ``RS``\\ :math:`n`\\ [``C``] card:"
msgstr ""
"对于非常大的基组，\\ ``RS2``\\ 、\\ ``RS2C`` 和 ``RS3`` 计算可以在积分直接模式下进行。如果输入中较早出现了全局的 "
"``DIRECT`` 或 ``GDIRECT`` 卡片，则计算将是直接的。或者，（主要用于测试）可以在 ``RS``\\ :math:`n`\\ "
"[``C``] 卡片上指定 ``DIRECT`` 作为选项："

msgid "CASPT2 gradients"
msgstr "CASPT2 梯度"

msgid ""
"Analytic gradients as described in P. Celani and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1597672>`__ **119**, 5044 (2003) are "
"available for the ``RS2`` program."
msgstr ""
"如 P. Celani 和 H.-J. Werner 在 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1597672>`__ **119**, 5044 (2003) 中所述，解析梯度可用于 "
"``RS2`` 程序。"

msgid ""
"In single state calculations, the gradient is automatically computed for the"
" state computed in CASPT2/RSPT2 (i.e., using ``STATE,1,2`` the second state "
"in the symmetry under consideration is computed, see section `excited state "
"calculations "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#excited-"
"state-calculations>`__). The program works with state-averaged MCSCF "
"(CASSCF) orbitals, and no ``CPMCSCF`` directive is needed. It is necessary "
"that the state under consideration is included in the preceding (state-"
"averaged) MCSCF/CASSCF. The RS2 gradient program can also be used to compute"
" state-averaged MCSCF/CASSCF gradients by using the ``NOEXC`` directive."
msgstr ""
"在单态计算中，梯度会自动针对 CASPT2/RSPT2 中计算的态进行计算（即，使用 ``STATE,1,2`` "
"会计算所考虑对称性中的第二个态，参见章节 `激发态计算 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#excited-"
"state-calculations>`__\\ ）。该程序使用态平均 MCSCF (CASSCF) 轨道工作，不需要 ``CPMCSCF`` "
"指令。所考虑的态必须包含在前置的（态平均）MCSCF/CASSCF 中。RS2 梯度程序也可以通过使用 ``NOEXC`` 指令来计算态平均 "
"MCSCF/CASSCF 梯度。"

msgid ""
"In a multi-state MS-MR-CASPT2 calculation, the state for which the gradient "
"is computed must be specified using the ``ROOT`` option (default "
"``ROOT=1``), i.e.,"
msgstr "在多态 MS-MR-CASPT2 计算中，必须使用 ``ROOT`` 选项（默认 ``ROOT=1``\\ ）指定要计算梯度的态，即，"

msgid "where :math:`1 \\le ioptroot \\le nstates`."
msgstr "其中 :math:`1 \\le ioptroot \\le nstates`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Level shifts can be used. By default, the exact gradient of the level-shift "
"corrected energy is computed. For a non-zero shift, this requires to solve "
"the CASPT2 Z-vector equations, which roughly doubles the computational "
"effort. In single state calculations it is possible to ignore the effect of "
"the level shift on the gradient and not to solve the Z-vector equation. This"
" variant, which is described in the above paper, may be sufficiently "
"accurate for many purposes. It is invoked using the ``IGNORE`` option, e.g."
msgstr ""
"可以使用能级位移。默认情况下，会计算能级位移校正能量的精确梯度。对于非零位移，这需要求解 CASPT2 "
"Z-向量方程，这大约会使计算量增加一倍。在单态计算中，可以忽略能级位移对梯度的影响，从而不求解 "
"Z-向量方程。这种变体在上述论文中有所描述，对于许多目的来说可能足够精确。可以使用 ``IGNORE`` 选项来调用它，例如："

msgid ""
"Any publications employing the CASPT2 gradients should cite the above paper."
" A citation for MS-CASPT2 gradient method is P. Celani and H.-J. Werner, *to"
" be published*."
msgstr ""
"任何使用 CASPT2 梯度的出版物都应引用上述论文。MS-CASPT2 梯度方法的引用是 P. Celani 和 H.-J. Werner，\\ "
"*待发表*\\ 。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "CASPT2 geometry optimizations for H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O:"
msgstr "H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O 的 CASPT2 几何优化："

msgid "This produces the Table"
msgstr "这将生成表格"

msgid ""
"MS-CASPT2 geometry optimization for the second excited :math:`^3B_2` state "
"if H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O:"
msgstr "H\\ :math:`_2`\\ O 的第二激发态 :math:`^3B_2` 的 MS-CASPT2 几何优化："

msgid "This produces the table"
msgstr "这将生成表格"

msgid "Coupling MRCI and MRPT2: The CIPT2 method"
msgstr "耦合MRCI与MRPT2：CIPT2方法"

msgid ""
"For particularly difficult cases with strong intruder problems, or in which "
"second-order perturbation theory fails to predict reliable results, a new "
"method that couples MRCI and CASPT2 has been developed. This variant is "
"invoked using the ``CIPT2`` directive:"
msgstr ""
"对于存在强入侵者问题或二阶微扰理论无法给出可靠结果的特别困难情况，已开发出一种耦合MRCI与CASPT2的新方法。此变体通过 ``CIPT2`` "
"指令调用："

msgid "``CIPT2``"
msgstr "``CIPT2``"

msgid ""
"In this case all excitations solely from active orbitals are treated by "
"MRCI, while the remaining excitations involving inactive (closed-shell) "
"orbitals are treated by second-order perturbation theory. Both methods are "
"coupled by minimizing an appropriate energy functional. Of course, this "
"method is much more expensive that MRPT2. The cost is comparable to the cost"
" for an MRCI without correlating the inactive orbitals."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，所有仅来自活性轨道的激发由MRCI处理，而其余涉及非活性（闭壳层）轨道的激发则由二阶微扰理论处理。两种方法通过最小化适当的能量泛函进行耦合。当然，此方法比MRPT2昂贵得多。其成本与不关联非活性轨道的MRCI成本相当。"

msgid "Further options for CASPT2 and CASPT3"
msgstr "CASPT2和CASPT3的进一步选项"

msgid ""
"Other options can be set using the ``OPTION`` command. These options are "
"mainly used for testing purposes and should be used with care. It should be "
"noted that the only option that can be modified in the RS2C program is "
"``IFDIA``: all others only work with RS2/RS3."
msgstr ""
"其他选项可使用 ``OPTION`` 命令设置。这些选项主要用于测试目的，应谨慎使用。需注意，在RS2C程序中唯一可修改的选项是 ``IFDIA``\\"
" ：其他选项仅适用于RS2/RS3。"

msgid "Of relevance for the CASPT2/3 program are the following options:"
msgstr "与 CASPT2/3 程序相关的选项如下："

msgid ""
"``IPROCS=0`` (Default). Calculation uses uncontracted singles with ``RS2``."
msgstr "``IPROCS=0`` （默认）。计算在 ``RS2`` 中使用非收缩单激发。"

msgid ""
"``IPROCS=1`` Non-interacting singles are projected out during update. This "
"is an approximate procedure which should be used with care."
msgstr "``IPROCS=1`` 在更新过程中将非相互作用单激发投影掉。这是一个近似方法，应谨慎使用。"

msgid ""
"``IPROCS=2`` The singles are fully internally contracted in ``RS2``. This is"
" achieved via a projection operator during the coefficient update and may be"
" inefficient. G"
msgstr "``IPROCS=2`` 单激发在 ``RS2`` 中完全内收缩。这是通过在系数更新期间使用投影算符实现的，可能效率较低。G"

msgid ""
"``IPROCS=3`` Only singles with one or two holes in the closed-shells are "
"internally contracted in ``RS2`` using a projection operator."
msgstr "``IPROCS=3`` 仅对闭壳层中有一个或两个空穴的单激发在 ``RS2`` 中使用投影算符进行内收缩。"

msgid ""
"``IPROCI=0`` (Default). Calculation uses uncontracted internals with "
"``RS2``."
msgstr "``IPROCI=0`` （默认）。计算在 ``RS2`` 中使用非收缩内激发。"

msgid ""
"``IPROCI=1`` Internals with two holes in the inactive space are internally "
"contracted in ``RS2`` using a projection operator."
msgstr "``IPROCI=1`` 在非活性空间中有两个空穴的内激发在 ``RS2`` 中使用投影算符进行内收缩。"

msgid ""
"``IPROCS=3,IPROCI=1`` This combination of options reproduces with ``RS2`` "
"the ``RS2C`` result using projection operators. This requires lot of memory "
"and disk space and it is feasible only for small molecules."
msgstr ""
"``IPROCS=3,IPROCI=1`` 此选项组合配合 ``RS2`` 使用投影算符可重现 ``RS2C`` "
"的结果。这需要大量内存和磁盘空间，仅适用于小分子体系。"

msgid ""
"``IFDIA=0`` (Default). All off-diagonal elements of the effective Fock "
"matrix are included."
msgstr "``IFDIA=0`` （默认值）。有效 Fock 矩阵的所有非对角元均被包含。"

msgid ""
"``IFDIA=1`` The internal-external block of the Fock-matrix is neglected. "
"This eliminates the single-pair coupling."
msgstr "``IFDIA=1`` Fock 矩阵的内-外块被忽略。这消除了单-对耦合。"

msgid ""
"``IFDIA=2`` All off-diagonal elements of the Fock matrix are neglected. This"
" corresponds to CASPT2D of Andersson et al. Note: in this case the result is"
" not invariant to rotations among active orbitals!"
msgstr ""
"``IFDIA=2`` Fock 矩阵的所有非对角元均被忽略。这对应于 Andersson 等人的 CASPT2D "
"方法。注意：在这种情况下，结果对于活性轨道间的旋转不是不变的！"

msgid ""
"``IHINT=0`` (Default). Only one-electron integrals are used in the zeroth-"
"order Hamiltonian for all interactions."
msgstr "``IHINT=0`` （默认值）。对于所有相互作用，零阶哈密顿量中仅使用单电子积分。"

msgid ""
"``IHINT=1`` The all-internal two-electron integrals are used in the zeroth-"
"order Hamiltonian for the internal-internal and single-single interactions."
msgstr "``IHINT=1`` 零阶哈密顿量中，对于内-内和单-单相互作用，使用全内双电子积分。"

msgid ""
"``IHINT=2`` The all-internal two-electron integrals in the zeroth-order "
"Hamiltonian are used for the internal-internal, single-single, and pair-pair"
" interactions. Using ``IHINT=2`` and ``IDFIA=1`` corresponds to Dyall’s "
"CAS/A method for the case that CASSCF references with no closed-shells "
"(inactive orbitals) are used. Note that this requires more CPU time than a "
"standard CASPT2 calculation. Moreover, convergence of the CAS/A method is "
"often slow (denominator shifts specified on a ``SHIFT`` card may be helpful "
"in such cases). In general, we do not recommend the use of ``IHINT`` with "
"nonzero values."
msgstr ""
"``IHINT=2`` 零阶哈密顿量中，对于内-内、单-单和对-对相互作用，使用全内双电子积分。使用 ``IHINT=2`` 和 ``IDFIA=1``"
" 对应于 Dyall 的 CAS/A 方法，适用于使用无闭壳层（无非活性轨道）的 CASSCF 参考的情况。注意：这比标准的 CASPT2 "
"计算需要更多的 CPU 时间。此外，CAS/A 方法的收敛通常较慢（在这种情况下，在 ``SHIFT`` "
"卡上指定的分母位移可能有所帮助）。通常，我们不建议使用非零值的 ``IHINT``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``NOREF=1`` (Default). Interactions between reference configurations and "
"singles are omitted."
msgstr "``NOREF=1`` （默认值）。参考组态与单激发组态之间的相互作用被忽略。"

msgid ""
"``NOREF=0`` Interactions between reference configurations and singles are "
"included. This causes a relaxation of the reference coefficients but may "
"lead to intruder-state problems."
msgstr "``NOREF=0`` 参考组态与单激发组态之间的相互作用被包含。这会导致参考系数的弛豫，但可能引发入侵态问题。"

msgid ""
"``IMP3=2`` After CASPT2 do variational CI using all internal configurations "
"and the first-order wavefunctions of all states as a basis. In this case the"
" second-order energy will correspond to the variational energy, and the "
"third-order energy approximately to a Davidson-corrected energy. This is "
"useful in excited state calculations with near-degeneracy situations."
msgstr ""
"``IMP3=2`` "
"在CASPT2之后，使用所有内部组态和所有态的一阶波函数作为基组进行变分CI计算。在这种情况下，二阶能量将对应于变分能量，而三阶能量近似于Davidson校正能量。这在具有近简并情况的激发态计算中很有用。"

msgid ""
"**``SHIFT=``\\ *value*** Level shift, see section `level shifts "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#level-"
"shifts>`__"
msgstr ""
"**``SHIFT=``\\ *\\ value*** 能级位移，见 `能级位移 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#level-"
"shifts>`__ 一节"

msgid ""
"**``IPEA=``\\ *value*** IPEA shift proposed by G. Ghigo, B. O. Roos, and "
"P.A. Malmqvist, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2004.08.032>`__ **396**, 142 (2004), "
"see section `level shifts "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#level-"
"shifts>`__."
msgstr ""
"**``IPEA=``\\ *\\ value*** 由 G. Ghigo、B. O. Roos 和 P.A. Malmqvist 提出的 IPEA "
"位移，`Chem. Phys. Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2004.08.032>`__ "
"**\\ 396**, 142 (2004)，见 `能级位移 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#level-"
"shifts>`__ 一节。"

msgid ""
"**``MIX=``\\ *nstates*** Invokes multi-state (MS-CASPT2) treatment using "
"*nstates* states. See section `Multi-State CASPT2 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#multi-state-"
"caspt2>`__ for more details."
msgstr ""
"**``MIX=``\\ *\\ nstates*** 使用 *\\ nstates* 个态调用多态（MS-CASPT2）处理。详见 `多态 "
"CASPT2 <multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#multi-"
"state-caspt2>`__ 一节。"

msgid "**``XMS=0``:** MS-CASPT2 method of Finley et al. CPL 288, 299 (1998)"
msgstr "**``XMS=0``：** Finley 等人的 MS-CASPT2 方法，CPL 288, 299 (1998)"

msgid ""
"**``XMS=1``:** Extended multi-state CASPT2 (XMS-CASPT2) method as described "
"in `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3633329>`__ **135**, 081106"
" (2011). fully invariant treatment of level shifts (recommended)."
msgstr ""
"**``XMS=1``：** 扩展多态 CASPT2（XMS-CASPT2）方法，如 `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3633329>`__ **135**, 081106 (2011) "
"所述。对能级位移进行完全不变的处理（推荐）。"

msgid ""
"**``XMS=2``:** XMS-CASPT2 method; level shift is only applied to the "
"diagonal of H0."
msgstr "**``XMS=2``：** XMS-CASPT2 方法；能级位移仅作用于 H0 的对角元。"

msgid ""
"**``ROOT=``\\ *ioptroot*** Root number to be optimized in geometry "
"optimization. This refers to the *nstates* included in the MS-CASPT2. See "
"section `CASPT2 gradients "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#caspt2-gradients>`__"
" for more details."
msgstr ""
"**``ROOT=``\\ *\\ ioptroot*** 在几何优化中要优化的根编号。这指的是 MS-CASPT2 中包含的 *\\ nstates*"
" 个态。详见 `CASPT2 梯度 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#caspt2-gradients>`__"
" 一节。"

msgid ""
"**``SAVEH=``\\ *record*** Record for saving the effective Hamiltonian in MS-"
"CASPT2 calculations. If this is not given, a default record will be used "
"(recommended)."
msgstr ""
"**``SAVEH=``\\ *\\ record*** 在 MS-CASPT2 "
"计算中保存有效哈密顿量所用的记录号。若未给出，将使用默认记录号（推荐）。"

msgid ""
"In addition, all valid options for ``MRCI`` can be given (see Sect. "
":doc:`the MRCI program <the_mrci_program>`)."
msgstr "此外，可以给出 ``MRCI`` 的所有有效选项（见 :doc:`MRCI 程序 <the_mrci_program>` 一节）。"

msgid ""
"**'Note: level shifts have to be given as options.** The SHIFT directive "
"refers to denominator shifts, which affect the convergence but not the "
"Hamiltonian and the results."
msgstr "**'注意：能级位移必须作为选项给出。** SHIFT 指令指的是分母位移，它影响收敛但不影响哈密顿量和结果。"

msgid ""
"The results of multireference perturbation theory may be sensitive to the "
"choice of the zeroth-order Hamiltonian. This dependence is more pronounced "
"in second-order than in third-order. Several options are available, which "
"will be described in the following sections. It may also happen that "
":math:`(\\hat H^{(0)} - E^{(0)})` in the basis of the configuration state "
"functions becomes (nearly) singular. This is known as \"intruder state "
"problem\" and can cause convergence problems or lead to a blow-up of the "
"wavefunction. Often, such problems can be eliminated by including more "
"orbitals into the reference wavefunction, but of course this leads to an "
"increase of the CPU time. The use of modified Fock operators (see below) or "
"level shifts, as proposed by Roos and Andersson `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(95)01010-7>`__ **245**, 215 (1995) may"
" also be helpful. Presently, only \"real\" level shifts have been "
"implemented."
msgstr ""
"多参考微扰理论的结果可能对零阶哈密顿量的选择敏感。这种依赖性在二阶比在三阶更明显。有多种选项可用，将在以下各节中描述。也可能出现 "
":math:`(\\hat H^{(0)} - E^{(0)})` "
"在组态态函数基下变得（接近）奇异的情况。这被称为“入侵态问题”，可能导致收敛问题或导致波函数发散。通常，这类问题可以通过在参考波函数中纳入更多轨道来消除，但这当然会增加"
" CPU 时间。使用修改的 Fock 算符（见下文）或能级位移（如 Roos 和 Andersson `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(95)01010-7>`__ **245**, 215 (1995) "
"所提出）也可能有所帮助。目前仅实现了“实”能级位移。"

msgid "``STATE,1,root``"
msgstr "``STATE,1,root``"

msgid ""
"where *root* is the desired root (i.e., 2 for the first excited state). In "
"this case the Fock operator used in the zeroth-order Hamiltonian is computed"
" using the density for the given state. Note that all states must have the "
"same symmetry."
msgstr ""
"其中 *root* 是所需的根（即第一个激发态为 2）。在这种情况下，零阶哈密顿量中使用的 Fock "
"算符使用给定态的密度计算。注意所有态必须具有相同的对称性。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, two or more states can be computed simultaneously, using"
msgstr "或者，可以使用以下方式同时计算两个或更多态"

msgid "``STATE, n [,root1, root2, …, rootn]``"
msgstr "``STATE, n [,root1, root2, …, rootn]``"

msgid "``WEIGHT,w1, w2,…,wn.``"
msgstr "``WEIGHT,w1, w2,…,wn.``"

msgid ""
"Each of the states to be mixed is computed independently, and finally all "
"states are mixed. In the following, such calculations will be denoted \"SS-"
"SR-CASPT2\" (single-state, single reference CASPT2). There is one contracted"
" reference state for each CASPT2 calculation that is specific for the state "
"under consideration. This is the cheapest method, but there are no gradients"
" available in this case. It is the users responsibility to make sure that no"
" state is computed twice."
msgstr ""
"要混合的每个态都独立计算，最后将所有态混合。在下文中，此类计算将记为“SS-SR-CASPT2”（单态、单参考 CASPT2）。每个 CASPT2 "
"计算有一个针对所考虑态特定的收缩参考态。这是最廉价的方法，但此情况下没有可用的梯度。用户有责任确保没有态被重复计算。"

msgid ""
"All *nstates* states are treated together, with *nstates* contracted "
"reference states. This is more expensive, but should give a more balanced "
"description since the different reference states can mix in the CASPT2. It "
"is required that *nstates* equals the number of states specified on the "
"``STATE`` directive. For this case, denoted \"MS-MR-CASPT2\" (multi-state "
"multi reference CASPT2), analytical energy gradients are available, see "
"section `CASPT2 gradients "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#caspt2-gradients>`__."
" It is recommended to use the \"extended\" (XMS) multi-state CASPT2 option, "
"which guarantees invariance of the theory with respect to unitary rotations "
"of the reference functions. The method yields improved potentials in the "
"vicinity of avoided crossings and conical intersections [see T. Shiozaki and"
" H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3489000>`__ "
"**133**, 141103 (2010) and T. Shiozaki, C. Woywod and H.-J. Werner, `Phys. "
"Chem. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C2CP43381H>`__ **15**, 262 "
"(2013)]."
msgstr ""
"所有 *nstates* 个态一起处理，使用 *nstates* 个收缩参考态。这更昂贵，但应能给出更均衡的描述，因为不同的参考态可以在 CASPT2 "
"中混合。要求 *nstates* 等于 ``STATE`` 指令上指定的态数。对于此种情况，记为“MS-MR-CASPT2”（多态多参考 "
"CASPT2），可使用解析能量梯度，见 `CASPT2 梯度 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#caspt2-gradients>`__"
" 一节。推荐使用“扩展”（XMS）多态 CASPT2 选项，它保证了理论对参考函数的酉旋转的不变性。该方法在避免交叉和锥形交叉附近给出改进的势能面 [见"
" T. Shiozaki 和 H.-J. Werner，\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.3489000>`__ **133**, 141103 (2010) 以及 T. "
"Shiozaki、C. Woywod 和 H.-J. Werner，\\ `Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C2CP43381H>`__ **15**, 262 (2013)]。"

msgid "Note that all states must have the same spin and spatial symmetry."
msgstr "注意所有态必须具有相同的自旋和空间对称性。"

msgid "``{RS2,MIX=nstates, INIT, options\\\\`` ``STATE,1,1;}``"
msgstr "``{RS2,MIX=nstates, INIT, options\\\\`` ``STATE,1,1;}``"

msgid "``{RS2,MIX=nstates, options\\\\`` ``STATE,1,$istate$;}``"
msgstr "``{RS2,MIX=nstates, options\\\\`` ``STATE,1,$istate$;}``"

