msgstr "``RS2,option\\\\`` ``RS2C,option\\\\`` ``RS3,option``"

msgid ""
"Note: level shifts have to be given as options. The SHIFT directive refers "
"to denominator shifts, which affect the convergence but not the Hamiltonian "
"and the results."
msgstr "注意：能级位移必须作为选项给出。SHIFT 指令指的是分母位移，它影响收敛但不影响哈密顿量和结果。"

