msgstr ""
"``RS2 [,G$n$] [,SHIFT=shift] [,DIRECT]\\\\`` "
"``RS2C [,G$n$] [,SHIFT=shift] [,DIRECT]``"

msgid ""
"CASPT2 analytic energy gradients are computed automatically if a ``FORCE`` "
"or ``OPTG`` command follows (see sections :doc:`energy gradients "
"<energy_gradients>` and :doc:`geometry optimization (OPTG) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg>`). Analytical gradients are presently only "
"available for ``RS2`` calculations (not ``RS2C``), and only for the standard"
" :math:`\\hat H^{(0)}` (not G1, G2 etc). Gradients can be computed for "
"single-state calculations, as well as multi-state MS-MR-CASPT2 (see section "
"`Multi-State CASPT2 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#multi-state-"
"caspt2>`__. However, only states with the same symmetry and spin and the "
"same number of electrons as in the optimized state can be included in the "
"preceding SA-CASSCF (CONFIG,DET must not be given in the CASSCF)."
msgstr ""
"如果后续紧跟 ``FORCE`` 或 ``OPTG`` 命令，CASPT2 解析能量梯度会自动计算（参见 :doc:`energy gradients "
"<energy_gradients>` 和 :doc:`geometry optimization (OPTG) "
"<geometry_optimization_optg>` 章节）。目前解析梯度仅适用于 ``RS2`` 计算（不适用于 ``RS2C``\\ "
"），且仅适用于标准的 :math:`\\hat H^{(0)}`\\ （不适用于 G1、G2 等）。梯度可用于单态计算，也可用于多态 MS-MR-"
"CASPT2（参见 `Multi-State CASPT2 "
"<multireference_rayleigh_schroedinger_perturbation_theory.html#multi-state-"
"caspt2>`__ 一节）。但是，只有与优化态具有相同对称性和自旋、且电子数相同的态才能包含在先前的 SA-CASSCF 中（CASSCF 中不得给出"
" CONFIG、DET）。"

